+        // Apply this draw call's own cull mode and depth test. PolygonAttrCommand also sets them on the GL state when the command
+        // arrives, but translucent draw calls are deferred to the end of the frame (DrawTransparentItems), so they would otherwise
+        // be drawn with whatever state the frame's last polygon attribute left behind (often GX_CULL_ALL: nothing drawn).
